config BR2_PACKAGE_OBAKE_CONTAINER
	bool "obake container runtime layer"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SINGULARITY
	help
	  The obake container runtime layer: the SingularityCE runtime that
	  the shapes execute as SIF images, together with its (considerable)
	  dependency set. This keeps the container runtime a single named
	  meta-package, separate from the audio/network runtime that
	  obake-runtime selects.

	  Future changes add further meta-packages (developer tooling,
	  audio-over-IP) the same way.
